{"id":"fa_cil","lemma":"fácil","pos":"adj","rank":343,"glosses":["easy, facile, simple (requiring little effort)","easy-to-use, user-friendly (clipping of fácil de usar)","easy (being readily available for sex)"],"ipa":"/ˈfaθil/","forms":{"femininePlural":"fáciles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-f%C3%A1cil.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto parece demasiado fácil.","en":"This seems too easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449292","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"too much"},null]},{"text":"Este libro me parece fácil.","en":"This book seems easy to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41028","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},null]},{"text":"Estas preguntas son fáciles de responder.","en":"These questions are easy to answer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568167","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"question","l":"pregunta"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to answer, to reply"}]},{"text":"No es tan fácil como piensas.","en":"It's not as easy as you think.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518095","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"}]},{"text":"Empecemos con las preguntas fáciles.","en":"Let's start with the easy questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645692","words":[{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"question","l":"pregunta"},null]}]}